Class OnlineRunGraph:
- build the documented LangGraph flow:
  prepare_context -> decide_tool_need -> tool_select -> tool_execute -> generate_result -> validate_result -> repair_result
- keep tool planning bounded and loop back through decide_tool_need after each execute round
- expose collect_tool_context() so the streaming path can reuse the exact same tool loop before preview streaming
- expose invoke() for the full structured generation and validation flow
- expose build_prompt_package() so services can build stream previews from the same injected context and tool facts
